lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group pi-horizontal-group-no-labels\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Notable Loot</caption>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Demonic%20Finger\"><img alt=\"Demonic Finger\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Demonic_Finger_fc2c12.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot2\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Steel%20Boots\"><img alt=\"Steel Boots\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Steel_Boots_d649a4.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot3\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Butcher's Axe\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Butcher_s_Axe_6ef4fc.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Giant%20Sword\"><img alt=\"Giant Sword\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Giant_Sword_32ae9e.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Dreaded Cleaver\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dreaded_Cleaver_202104.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Maps and Pictures</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"map\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Shab1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"82\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Shab1_b7a0e0.jpg\" width=\"125\"/></span> </div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">9.10<br/>July 6, 2011<br/>Summer Update 2011</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>The <b>Demonwar Crypt</b> is a good place for mages. To reach it, enter the <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/Hero%20Cave\">Hero Cave</a> and go into the portal <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33167,31648,13\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33167, 31648, 13)</a>. When going through the teleporter you will appear in a room with NPC <a href=\"#/wiki/A%20Dark%20Priestess\">A Dark Priestess</a>. From there you can take stairs up to the <b>Demonwar Crypt</b>. Be prepared to fight 4-6 <a href=\"#/wiki/Shaburak%20Demon\">Shaburak Demons</a> at once, so take with you a few <a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Ring\">Energy Rings</a> to reduce waste. Bring a lot of <a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Shower%20Rune\">Stone Shower Runes</a>/<a href=\"#/wiki/Fireball%20Rune\">Fireball Runes</a> and use Magma Set/<a href=\"#/wiki/Terra%20Set\">Terra Set</a> for hunting Shaburaks/Askaraks. Also bring a couple of Backpacks to collect the huge amounts of gold they drop.\n</p><p>You can ask any <a href=\"#/wiki/Informer%20NPCs\">Guide NPC</a> after the <b>Demon War</b> and he will inform you of the power balance between the two races of Demons. <b>Note</b>: The Princes and Lords only spawn when this balance is disturbed, and Guide NPCs can tell you whether or not this is the case. To disturb the balance, kill a lot of Demons of just one side. Check <a href=\"#/quest/demon-wars-world-change\">Demon Wars World Change</a> to know more.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Tips_and_Tricks\">Tips and Tricks</span></h2>\n<p>Use <a href=\"#/wiki/Poison%20Bomb%20Rune\">Poison Bomb Runes</a> for trapping <a href=\"#/wiki/Shaburak%20Demon\">Shaburak Demons</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Bomb%20Rune\">Fire Bomb Runes</a> for <a href=\"#/wiki/Askarak%20Demon\">Askarak Demons</a>. After the ladder to the 2d floor there are 5-6 demons at once, so fields will help you to win some seconds for casting <a href=\"#/wiki/Magic%20Wall%20Rune\">Magic Walls</a> or Wild Growth. \n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Demonwar Crypt</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span 